#. what the crew asks, or what the crew is asked
#: data/missions/09_pilgrims_of_st_nicholas/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Which one is Luka? Remember what the people told you!"
msgstr "Cili është Luka? Kujtoni çfarë ju thanë njerëzit!"

#. a line after a wrong pick
#: data/missions/09_pilgrims_of_st_nicholas/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "No, that is not Luka! Think of everything you heard."
