#. a fun fact at the end of a mission, at most three sentences
#: data/missions/09_pilgrims_of_st_nicholas/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The whole floor of Otranto cathedral is one huge mosaic, made in the 1160s by artists led by a "
"monk called Pantaleon, with a great Tree of Life running along it."
msgstr ""
"E gjithë dyshemeja e katedrales së Otrantos është një mozaik i madh, i bërë në vitet 1160 nga "
"artistë të udhëhequr nga një murg i quajtur Pantaleon, me një Pemë të madhe të Jetës përgjatë saj."

#. the headline of the screen at the end of a mission, a few words
#: data/missions/09_pilgrims_of_st_nicholas/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "The pilgrims are home!"
msgstr "Pelegrinët janë në shtëpi!"

#. what the crew achieved, on the screen at the end of a mission, one sentence
#: data/missions/09_pilgrims_of_st_nicholas/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "You found Luka and took the pilgrims home across the sea."
msgstr "E gjetët Lukën dhe i çuat pelegrinët në shtëpi përtej detit."

#. what the crew achieved, on the screen at the end of a mission, one sentence
#: data/missions/09_pilgrims_of_st_nicholas/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "In Ragusa, the bells ring for them."
msgstr "Në Raguza, kambanat bien për ta."

#. a line which a person says, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/10_corsairs_of_ulcinj/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Captain! The corsairs of Ulcinj took all our olive oil."
msgstr ""
"{crew|Kapiten|Kapitene|Kapitenë|Kapitene}! Korsarët e Ulqinit na morën gjithë vajin e ullirit."

#. a line which a person says, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/10_corsairs_of_ulcinj/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "We traded it for the winter, and now we have nothing."
msgstr "E kishim marrë me shkëmbim për dimrin dhe tani nuk kemi asgjë."

#. a line which a person says, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/10_corsairs_of_ulcinj/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Nobody fights them. Go and ask what they want for it!"
msgstr "Askush nuk lufton me ta. Shkoni dhe pyetni çfarë duan për të!"

#. what a person in a chain of trades wants, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/10_corsairs_of_ulcinj/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Oil for oil? No, no. My sail is torn to rags."
msgstr "Vaj për vaj? Jo, jo. Veli im është bërë copë e leckë."

#. what a person in a chain of trades wants, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/10_corsairs_of_ulcinj/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Bring me a new sail, and you get your oil back."
msgstr "Më sillni një vel të ri dhe e merrni vajin mbrapsht."

#. what a person in a chain of trades wants, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/10_corsairs_of_ulcinj/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "The sailmaker of Durrës makes the best sails."
msgstr "Mjeshtri i velave në Durrës bën velat më të mira."

#. what a person says after a trade, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/10_corsairs_of_ulcinj/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "A new sail! Fine work. Here is your oil, captain."
msgstr "Një vel i ri! Punë e bukur. Ja vaji juaj, {crew|kapiten|kapitene|kapitenë|kapitene}."

#. what a person says after a trade, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/10_corsairs_of_ulcinj/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "And tell the Aga that Crooked Mast is not his friend."
msgstr "Dhe thojini Agait se Direku i Shtrembër nuk është miku i tij."

#. what a person in a chain of trades wants, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/10_corsairs_of_ulcinj/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "A sail? Gladly, but my cough is so bad, I can not work."
msgstr "Një vel? Me kënaqësi, por kolla ime është aq e keqe, sa nuk mund të punoj."

#. what a person in a chain of trades wants, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/10_corsairs_of_ulcinj/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Only the honey of Vlorë helps."
msgstr "Vetëm mjalti i Vlorës ndihmon."

#. what a person in a chain of trades wants, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/10_corsairs_of_ulcinj/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Bring me a jar of honey!"
msgstr "Më sillni një kavanoz me mjaltë!"

#. what a person says after a trade, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/10_corsairs_of_ulcinj/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Honey from Vlorë! My cough is gone already."
msgstr "Mjaltë nga Vlora! Kolla m'u zhduk që tani."

#. what a person says after a trade, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/10_corsairs_of_ulcinj/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Here is the sail. The finest in the Adriatic!"
msgstr "Ja veli. Më i miri në Adriatik!"

#. what a person in a chain of trades wants, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/10_corsairs_of_ulcinj/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Honey? My bees made plenty."
msgstr "Mjaltë? Bletët e mia bënë plot."

#. what a person in a chain of trades wants, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/10_corsairs_of_ulcinj/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "But I need salt for my cheese. Do you have salt on board?"
msgstr "Por më duhet kripë për djathin. Keni kripë në bord?"

#. what a person says after a trade, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/10_corsairs_of_ulcinj/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Salt! Just what I needed."
msgstr "Kripë! Pikërisht ajo që më duhej."

#. what a person says after a trade, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/10_corsairs_of_ulcinj/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Here is a jar of my best honey."
msgstr "Ja një kavanoz me mjaltin tim më të mirë."

#. the objective while sailing, on the banner
#: data/missions/10_corsairs_of_ulcinj/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Bring the olive oil home to {port}."
msgstr "Kthejeni vajin e ullirit në shtëpi, {port@to}."

#. a line of thanks, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/10_corsairs_of_ulcinj/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Our oil! Now we have enough for the winter."
msgstr "Vaji ynë! Tani kemi mjaftueshëm për dimrin."

#. a line which a person says, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/10_corsairs_of_ulcinj/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Crooked Mast sent a message, too:"
msgstr "Edhe Direku i Shtrembër dërgoi një mesazh:"

#. a line which a person says, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/10_corsairs_of_ulcinj/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "\"The Aga's scribe sails south with a heavy book. Watch out for him!\""
msgstr "\"Shkruesi i Agait po lundron drejt jugut me një libër të rëndë. Kujdes prej tij!\""

#. the title of a mission, on its card
#: data/missions/10_corsairs_of_ulcinj/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Corsairs of Ulcinj"
msgstr "Korsarët e Ulqinit"

#. the summary of a mission, one or two short sentences
#: data/missions/10_corsairs_of_ulcinj/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "The corsairs took the villages' olive oil. Find out what they want, and trade it back."
msgstr ""
"Korsarët morën vajin e ullirit të fshatrave. Zbuloni çfarë duan dhe merreni mbrapsht me shkëmbim."

#. a fun fact at the end of a mission, at most three sentences
#: data/missions/10_corsairs_of_ulcinj/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The olive trees of the Adriatic grow very old: near Bar in Montenegro stands an olive tree which "
"is said to be more than two thousand years old."
msgstr ""
"Ullinjtë e Adriatikut plaken shumë: pranë Tivarit, në Mal të Zi, ka një ulli që thonë se është më "
"shumë se dy mijë vjeç."

#. the headline of the screen at the end of a mission, a few words
#: data/missions/10_corsairs_of_ulcinj/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "The oil is home!"
msgstr "Vaji është në shtëpi!"

#. what the crew achieved, on the screen at the end of a mission, one sentence
#: data/missions/10_corsairs_of_ulcinj/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Not a single shot was fired: a sail, a jar of honey and a sack of salt did it."
msgstr "Asnjë e shtënë: e bënë një vel, një kavanoz me mjaltë dhe një thes me kripë."

#. what the crew achieved, on the screen at the end of a mission, one sentence
#: data/missions/10_corsairs_of_ulcinj/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Even the corsair captain is your friend now."
msgstr "Edhe kapiteni i korsarëve tani është miku juaj."

#. a line which a person says, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/11_oranges_of_parga/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Captain, the Aga wants the oranges of Parga as a tax!"
msgstr "{crew|Kapiten|Kapitene|Kapitenë|Kapitene}, Agai do portokallet e Pargës si taksë!"

#. a line which a person says, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/11_oranges_of_parga/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Eleni of Parga hid the harvest from his men."
msgstr "Eleni nga Parga i fshehu portokallet e vjela nga njerëzit e tij."

#. a line which a person says, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/11_oranges_of_parga/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Help her get the oranges to the market of Corfu, so that the money stays with the people."
msgstr "Ndihmojeni të çojë portokallet në tregun e Korfuzit, që paratë të mbeten te njerëzit."

#. what a person in a chain of trades wants, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/11_oranges_of_parga/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "The oranges are ripe, but the Aga's men broke all my baskets."
msgstr "Portokallet janë pjekur, por njerëzit e Agait m'i thyen të gjitha shportat."

#. what a person in a chain of trades wants, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/11_oranges_of_parga/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Bring me baskets! Ilir of Vlorë weaves the best ones."
msgstr "Më sillni shporta! Ilir nga Vlora thur më të mirat."

#. what a person says after a trade, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/11_oranges_of_parga/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Fine baskets! Here are the oranges, captain."
msgstr "Shporta të bukura! Ja portokallet, {crew|kapiten|kapitene|kapitenë|kapitene}."

#. what a person says after a trade, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/11_oranges_of_parga/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Smell them: the sun of Parga is inside."
msgstr "Merrini erë: brenda tyre është dielli i Pargës."

#. what a person in a chain of trades wants, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/11_oranges_of_parga/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "I weave baskets from the reeds of the lagoon."
msgstr "Unë thur shporta nga kallamat e lagunës."

#. what a person in a chain of trades wants, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/11_oranges_of_parga/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "But my boat lost its rope. Spiros in Corfu has ropes!"
msgstr "Por barka ime humbi litarin. Spiros në Korfuz ka litarë!"

#. what a person says after a trade, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/11_oranges_of_parga/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "A good rope! Here are my baskets."
msgstr "Një litar i mirë! Ja shportat e mia."

#. what a person in a chain of trades wants, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/11_oranges_of_parga/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "A rope for Ilir? The harbour of Corfu has ropes for everybody."
msgstr "Një litar për Ilirin? Porti i Korfuzit ka litarë për të gjithë."

#. what a person says after a trade, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/11_oranges_of_parga/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Take this one, captain."
msgstr "Merreni këtë, {crew|kapiten|kapitene|kapitenë|kapitene}."

#. the objective while sailing, on the banner
#: data/missions/11_oranges_of_parga/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Bring the oranges to the market of {port}."
msgstr "Çojini portokallet në treg, {port@to}."

#. a line of thanks, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/11_oranges_of_parga/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Oranges from Parga! The whole market smells of them."
msgstr "Portokalle nga Parga! I gjithë tregu mban erë portokalle."

#. a line of thanks, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/11_oranges_of_parga/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "The money goes to the people of Parga, not to the Aga."
msgstr "Paratë shkojnë te njerëzit e Pargës, jo te Agai."

#. a line which a person says, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/11_oranges_of_parga/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Every orange was sold, and Parga keeps its money."
msgstr "U shit çdo portokall dhe Parga i mban paratë e saj."

#. a line which a person says, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/11_oranges_of_parga/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Aga gets only the peels!"
msgstr "Agait i mbeten vetëm lëvoret!"

#. the title of a mission, on its card
#: data/missions/11_oranges_of_parga/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Oranges of Parga"
msgstr "Portokallet e Pargës"

#. the summary of a mission, one or two short sentences
#: data/missions/11_oranges_of_parga/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The Aga wants the oranges of Parga as a tax. Trade your way to baskets and bring the oranges to "
"the market of Corfu."
msgstr ""
"Agai do portokallet e Pargës si taksë. Bëni shkëmbime deri te shportat dhe çojini portokallet në "
"tregun e Korfuzit."

#. a fun fact at the end of a mission, at most three sentences
#: data/missions/11_oranges_of_parga/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Parga was a little Venetian town on the Greek coast for almost 400 years, with Ottoman lands all "
"around it, and it was often raided by its neighbours."
msgstr ""
"Parga ishte një qytezë veneciane në bregun grek për gati 400 vjet, me toka osmane përreth, dhe "
"fqinjët e sulmonin shpesh."

#. the headline of the screen at the end of a mission, a few words
#: data/missions/11_oranges_of_parga/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Sweet oranges for Corfu!"
msgstr "Portokalle të ëmbla për Korfuzin!"

#. what the crew achieved, on the screen at the end of a mission, one sentence
#: data/missions/11_oranges_of_parga/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "The oranges reached the market, and the money stayed in Parga."
msgstr "Portokallet arritën në treg dhe paratë mbetën në Pargë."

#. what the crew achieved, on the screen at the end of a mission, one sentence
#: data/missions/11_oranges_of_parga/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "A rope, a basket and a lot of sailing did it."
msgstr "E bënë një litar, një shportë dhe shumë lundrim."

#. a line which a person says, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/12_forged_ledger/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Captain, the warning of Crooked Mast came true!"
msgstr ""
"{crew|Kapiten|Kapitene|Kapitenë|Kapitene}, paralajmërimi i Direkut të Shtrembër doli i vërtetë!"

#. a line which a person says, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/12_forged_ledger/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Aga's scribe was here with a heavy book: the ledger of the double taxes."
msgstr "Shkruesi i Agait ishte këtu me një libër të rëndë: librin e taksave të dyfishta."

#. a line which a person says, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/12_forged_ledger/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "With it, we can prove everything. But he fled in a hurry. Chase him!"
msgstr "Me të, mund t'i provojmë të gjitha. Por ai iku me nxitim. Ndiqeni!"

#. a clue; {hallmark} is a noun phrase like 'a patched red sail'
#: data/missions/12_forged_ledger/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "The scribe had {hallmark}."
msgstr "Shkruesi kishte {hallmark@acc}."

#. what the crew asks, or what the crew is asked
#: data/missions/12_forged_ledger/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Have you seen the Aga's scribe with a heavy book?"
msgstr "E keni parë shkruesin e Agait me një libër të rëndë?"

#. a line in the last port of a trail
#: data/missions/12_forged_ledger/mission.tres data/missions/24_count_flees/mission.tres
#: data/missions/32_stewards_ledger/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "He is here, hiding among the people of the harbour! But which one is he?"
msgstr "Është këtu, i fshehur mes njerëzve të portit! Po cili është ai?"

#. what the crew asks, or what the crew is asked
#: data/missions/12_forged_ledger/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Which one is the Aga's scribe?"
msgstr "Cili është shkruesi i Agait?"

#. a line after a wrong pick
#: data/missions/12_forged_ledger/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "No, that is not the scribe! Remember all four things you learned."
msgstr "Jo, ky nuk është shkruesi! Kujtoni të katër gjërat që mësuat."

#. a line after the right pick
#: data/missions/12_forged_ledger/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "\"Alright, alright! Here is the ledger. I only wrote what the Aga told me!\""
msgstr "\"Mirë, mirë! Ja libri. Unë shkrova vetëm atë që më tha Agai!\""

#. a line which a person says, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/12_forged_ledger/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "\"I will tell the truth before the judge, I promise.\""
msgstr "\"Do ta them të vërtetën para gjykatësit, e premtoj.\""

#. a line which a person says, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/12_forged_ledger/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "The ledger proves it: the Aga took every tax twice!"
msgstr "Libri e provon: Agai e mori çdo taksë dy herë!"

#. the title of a mission, on its card
#: data/missions/12_forged_ledger/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Forged Ledger"
msgstr "Libri i falsifikuar"

#. the summary of a mission, one or two short sentences
#: data/missions/12_forged_ledger/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Aga's scribe flees with the ledger of the double taxes. Chase him along the coast!"
msgstr "Shkruesi i Agait ikën me librin e taksave të dyfishta. Ndiqeni përgjatë bregut!"

#. a fun fact at the end of a mission, at most three sentences
#: data/missions/12_forged_ledger/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Spectacles were made in Venice from about 1300 on; the glassmakers of Murano were so precious that"
" they were not allowed to leave the republic."
msgstr ""
"Syzet bëheshin në Venecia që rreth vitit 1300; qelqtarët e Muranos ishin aq të çmuar sa nuk "
"lejoheshin të largoheshin nga republika."

#. the headline of the screen at the end of a mission, a few words
#: data/missions/12_forged_ledger/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "The ledger is yours!"
msgstr "Libri është juaji!"

#. what the crew achieved, on the screen at the end of a mission, one sentence
#: data/missions/12_forged_ledger/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "You chased the scribe along the whole coast and found him."
msgstr "E ndoqët shkruesin përgjatë gjithë bregut dhe e gjetët."

#. what the crew achieved, on the screen at the end of a mission, one sentence
#: data/missions/12_forged_ledger/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Now the crew holds the proof of the double taxes."
msgstr "Tani ekuipazhi ka provën e taksave të dyfishta."

#. a line which a person says, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/13_secret_script/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Captain, I must confess something."
msgstr "{crew|Kapiten|Kapitene|Kapitenë|Kapitene}, duhet t'ju rrëfej diçka."

#. a line which a person says, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/13_secret_script/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"I wrote the list of the villages in the old Glagolitic letters, so that the Aga could not read it."
msgstr ""
"Listën e fshatrave e shkrova me shkronjat e vjetra glagolitike, që Agai të mos e lexonte dot."

#. a line which a person says, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/13_secret_script/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Now I can not read it either! Find a priest who knows the old letters."
msgstr "Tani as unë nuk e lexoj dot! Gjeni një prift që i njeh shkronjat e vjetra."

#. a clue; {hallmark} is a noun phrase like 'a patched red sail'
#: data/missions/13_secret_script/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "The priest has {hallmark}."
msgstr "Prifti ka {hallmark@acc}."

#. what the crew asks, or what the crew is asked
#: data/missions/13_secret_script/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Have you seen a priest who knows the old letters?"
msgstr "E keni parë një prift që i njeh shkronjat e vjetra?"

#. a line in the last port of a trail
#: data/missions/13_secret_script/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Don Grgur is here, at the market! But which one is he?"
msgstr "Don Grgur është këtu, në treg! Po cili është ai?"

#. what the crew asks, or what the crew is asked
#: data/missions/13_secret_script/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Which one is Don Grgur? Remember what the people told you!"
msgstr "Cili është Don Grgur? Kujtoni çfarë ju thanë njerëzit!"

#. a line after a wrong pick
#: data/missions/13_secret_script/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "No, that is not him! Think of all three things you learned."
msgstr "Jo, nuk është ai! Kujtoni të tria gjërat që mësuat."

#. a line after the right pick
#: data/missions/13_secret_script/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "\"Yes, I read the old letters. Let me see... every village, and every ducat!\""
msgstr "\"Po, i lexoj shkronjat e vjetra. Le ta shoh... çdo fshat dhe çdo dukat!\""

#. the objective while sailing, on the banner
#: data/missions/13_secret_script/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Bring the list back to the scribe in {port}."
msgstr "Kthejeni listën te shkruesi {port@in}."

#. a line of thanks, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/13_secret_script/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Every village and every ducat, written clearly at last!"
msgstr "Çdo fshat dhe çdo dukat, të shkruar qartë më në fund!"

#. a line of thanks, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/13_secret_script/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Now the judge can give back every coin."
msgstr "Tani gjykatësi mund ta kthejë çdo monedhë."

#. a line which a person says, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/13_secret_script/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "The list is ready for the judge."
msgstr "Lista është gati për gjykatësin."

#. a line which a person says, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/13_secret_script/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "I will never write in a secret script again!"
msgstr "Kurrë më nuk do të shkruaj me shkrim të fshehtë!"

#. the title of a mission, on its card
#: data/missions/13_secret_script/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Secret Script"
msgstr "Shkrimi i fshehtë"

#. the summary of a mission, one or two short sentences
#: data/missions/13_secret_script/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The list of the villages is written in old Glagolitic letters. Find a priest who can read it."
msgstr ""
"Lista e fshatrave është shkruar me shkronja të vjetra glagolitike. Gjeni një prift që mund ta "
"lexojë."

#. a fun fact at the end of a mission, at most three sentences
#: data/missions/13_secret_script/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Glagolitic is the oldest known Slavic alphabet. On the islands of Kvarner, like Krk, and on the "
"islands near Zadar, Croatian priests and scribes kept writing in it for centuries."
msgstr ""
"Glagolitikja është alfabeti sllav më i vjetër që njohim. Në ishujt e Kvarnerit, si Krku, dhe në "
"ishujt pranë Zadarit, priftërinjtë dhe shkruesit kroatë vazhduan të shkruanin me të për shekuj."

#. the headline of the screen at the end of a mission, a few words
#: data/missions/13_secret_script/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "The list is read!"
msgstr "Lista u lexua!"

#. what the crew achieved, on the screen at the end of a mission, one sentence
#: data/missions/13_secret_script/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Don Grgur read the old letters for you."
msgstr "Don Grgur jua lexoi shkronjat e vjetra."

#. what the crew achieved, on the screen at the end of a mission, one sentence
#: data/missions/13_secret_script/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Now the judge will know every village and every ducat."
msgstr "Tani gjykatësi do ta dijë çdo fshat dhe çdo dukat."

#. a line which a person says, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/14_the_witnesses/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Captain, the judge wants to hear witnesses, not only the ledger."
msgstr ""
"{crew|Kapiten|Kapitene|Kapitenë|Kapitene}, gjykatësi do të dëgjojë dëshmitarë, jo vetëm librin."

#. a line which a person says, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/14_the_witnesses/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Crooked Mast in Ulcinj, Mustafa in Castelnuovo and Jele in Kotor saw what the Aga's men did."
msgstr ""
"Direku i Shtrembër në Ulqin, Mustafa në Castelnuovo dhe Jele në Kotor panë çfarë bënë njerëzit e "
"Agait."

#. a line which a person says, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/14_the_witnesses/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Bring all three to Corfu, where the voyage to the judge begins!"
msgstr "Sillini të tre në Korfuz, ku nis udhëtimi për te gjykatësi!"

#. a line which a person says, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/14_the_witnesses/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Me, a witness? Ha! Fine."
msgstr "Unë, dëshmitar? Ha! Mirë pra."

#. a line which a person says, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/14_the_witnesses/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "I saw the Aga's men take a tax twice, right at sea."
msgstr "I pashë njerëzit e Agait të merrnin një taksë dy herë, mu në det."

#. a line which a person says, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/14_the_witnesses/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "I keep the gate of Castelnuovo."
msgstr "Unë ruaj portën e Castelnuovos."

#. a line which a person says, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/14_the_witnesses/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Every cart of the Aga's men went through it, twice."
msgstr "Çdo karrocë e njerëzve të Agait kaloi nëpër të, dy herë."

#. a line which a person says, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/14_the_witnesses/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "They took my olives as a tax, and came back a week later for more."
msgstr "M'i morën ullinjtë si taksë dhe u kthyen pas një jave për më shumë."

#. a line which a person says, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/14_the_witnesses/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "I will tell the judge everything."
msgstr "Do t'i tregoj gjykatësit gjithçka."

#. the objective while sailing, on the banner
#: data/missions/14_the_witnesses/mission.tres data/missions/15_kadi_of_preveza/mission.tres
#: data/missions/25_royal_audience_of_trani/mission.tres
#: data/missions/34_through_the_bura/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Pick up {count} more {count|witness|witnesses}."
msgstr "Merrni edhe {count} {count|dëshmitar|dëshmitarë}."

#. the objective while sailing, on the banner
#: data/missions/14_the_witnesses/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Bring the witnesses to {port}."
msgstr "Çojini dëshmitarët {port@to}."

#. a line of thanks, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/14_the_witnesses/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Crooked Mast? A corsair as a witness... the judge will be surprised!"
msgstr "Direku i Shtrembër? Një korsar si dëshmitar... gjykatësi do të habitet!"

#. a line of thanks, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/14_the_witnesses/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Mustafa, the gatekeeper. Welcome to Corfu!"
msgstr "Mustafa, rojtari i portës. Mirë se erdhe në Korfuz!"

#. a line of thanks, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/14_the_witnesses/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Jele of Kotor. Rest a little, the voyage is long."
msgstr "Jele nga Kotori. Pusho pak, udhëtimi është i gjatë."

#. a line which a person says, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/14_the_witnesses/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "The witnesses are ready, and so is the ledger."
msgstr "Dëshmitarët janë gati, po ashtu edhe libri."

#. a line which a person says, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/14_the_witnesses/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Soon, the voyage to the judge begins!"
msgstr "Së shpejti nis udhëtimi për te gjykatësi!"

#. the title of a mission, on its card
#: data/missions/14_the_witnesses/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Witnesses"
msgstr "Dëshmitarët"

#. the summary of a mission, one or two short sentences
#: data/missions/14_the_witnesses/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "The judge wants to hear witnesses. Bring them from Ulcinj, Castelnuovo and Kotor to Corfu."
msgstr "Gjykatësi do të dëgjojë dëshmitarë. Sillini nga Ulqini, Castelnuovo dhe Kotori në Korfuz."

#. a fun fact at the end of a mission, at most three sentences
#: data/missions/14_the_witnesses/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The Republic of Ragusa banned the slave trade in 1416. It valued freedom very highly: the word "
"Libertas stands on its flag."
msgstr ""
"Republika e Raguzës e ndaloi tregtinë e skllevërve në vitin 1416. E çmonte shumë lirinë: fjala "
"Libertas qëndron në flamurin e saj."

#. the headline of the screen at the end of a mission, a few words
#: data/missions/14_the_witnesses/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "The witnesses are ready!"
msgstr "Dëshmitarët janë gati!"

#. what the crew achieved, on the screen at the end of a mission, one sentence
#: data/missions/14_the_witnesses/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "A corsair, a gatekeeper and an olive grower will speak before the judge."
msgstr "Një korsar, një rojtar porte dhe një kultivuese ullinjsh do të flasin para gjykatësit."

#. what the crew achieved, on the screen at the end of a mission, one sentence
#: data/missions/14_the_witnesses/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Aga's days as a tax collector are numbered."
msgstr "Ditët e Agait si mbledhës taksash janë të numëruara."

#. a line which a person says, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/15_kadi_of_preveza/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Captain, the day has come!"
msgstr "{crew|Kapiten|Kapitene|Kapitenë|Kapitene}, dita erdhi!"

#. a line which a person says, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/15_kadi_of_preveza/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Bring the ledger and the witnesses to the kadı of Preveza: he judges by the law."
