#. a line of thanks, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/18_pilgrims_of_loreto/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "And not a single coin for the Count's toll."
msgstr "Dhe asnjë monedhë për taksën e Kontit."

#. a line which a person says, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/18_pilgrims_of_loreto/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "The pilgrims pray in the Holy House, and they sing all the way home."
msgstr "Pelegrinët luten në Shtëpinë e Shenjtë dhe këndojnë gjatë gjithë rrugës për në shtëpi."

#. a line which a person says, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/18_pilgrims_of_loreto/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "And the Count's toll man? He went home to think about riddles."
msgstr "Po taksambledhësi i Kontit? Shkoi në shtëpi të mendojë për gjëegjëzat."

#. the title of a mission, on its card
#: data/missions/18_pilgrims_of_loreto/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Pilgrims of Loreto"
msgstr "Pelegrinët e Loretos"

#. the summary of a mission, one or two short sentences
#: data/missions/18_pilgrims_of_loreto/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Carry the pilgrims of Pescara past the Count's \"pilgrim toll\" to the Holy House of Loreto."
msgstr ""
"Çojini pelegrinët e Peskarës përtej \"taksës së pelegrinëve\" të Kontit, te Shtëpia e Shenjtë e "
"Loretos."

#. a fun fact at the end of a mission, at most three sentences
#: data/missions/18_pilgrims_of_loreto/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"A legend says that angels carried the Holy House of Mary from Nazareth to Loreto. Because of that "
"flying house, the Madonna of Loreto became the patron saint of pilots in 1920."
msgstr ""
"Një legjendë thotë se engjëjt e sollën Shtëpinë e Shenjtë të Marisë nga Nazareti në Loreto. Për "
"shkak të asaj shtëpie fluturuese, Zoja e Loretos u bë mbrojtësja e pilotëve të avionëve më 1920."

#. the headline of the screen at the end of a mission, a few words
#: data/missions/18_pilgrims_of_loreto/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "The pilgrims reached Loreto!"
msgstr "Pelegrinët arritën në Loreto!"

#. what the crew achieved, on the screen at the end of a mission, one sentence
#: data/missions/18_pilgrims_of_loreto/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "You carried the pilgrims past the Count's toll."
msgstr "I kaluat pelegrinët përtej taksës së Kontit."

#. what the crew achieved, on the screen at the end of a mission, one sentence
#: data/missions/18_pilgrims_of_loreto/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Not one of them paid a coin."
msgstr "Asnjëri prej tyre nuk pagoi asnjë monedhë."

#. a line which a person says, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/19_paper_with_a_secret/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Captain, the Count's toll man left behind a page of the Count's charter."
msgstr ""
"{crew|Kapiten|Kapitene|Kapitenë|Kapitene}, taksambledhësi i Kontit la pas një faqe të kartës së "
"Kontit."

#. a line which a person says, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/19_paper_with_a_secret/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Count says it is twenty years old. A paper merchant could tell!"
msgstr "Konti thotë se është njëzetvjeçare. Një tregtar letre do ta dinte!"

#. a line which a person says, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/19_paper_with_a_secret/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Ser Anselmo of Fabriano sails along the coast. Find him!"
msgstr "Ser Anselmo nga Fabriano lundron përgjatë bregut. Gjejeni!"

#. a clue; {hallmark} is a noun phrase like 'a patched red sail'
#: data/missions/19_paper_with_a_secret/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "The paper merchant has {hallmark}."
msgstr "Tregtari i letrës ka {hallmark@acc}."

#. what the crew asks, or what the crew is asked
#: data/missions/19_paper_with_a_secret/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Have you seen Ser Anselmo, the paper merchant?"
msgstr "E keni parë Ser Anselmon, tregtarin e letrës?"

#. a line in the last port of a trail
#: data/missions/19_paper_with_a_secret/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "He is here, at the market! But which one is he?"
msgstr "Ai është këtu, në treg! Po cili është ai?"

#. what the crew asks, or what the crew is asked
#: data/missions/19_paper_with_a_secret/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Which one is Ser Anselmo? Remember what the people told you!"
msgstr "Cili është Ser Anselmo? Kujtoni çfarë ju thanë njerëzit!"

#. a line after a wrong pick
#: data/missions/19_paper_with_a_secret/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "No, that is not Ser Anselmo! Think of everything you heard."
msgstr "Jo, ky nuk është Ser Anselmo! Kujtoni gjithçka që dëgjuat."

#. a line after the right pick
#: data/missions/19_paper_with_a_secret/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "\"A paper with a secret? Take me to it, captain!\""
msgstr "\"Një letër me një të fshehtë? Më çoni tek ajo!\""

#. the objective while sailing, on the banner
#: data/missions/19_paper_with_a_secret/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Bring Ser Anselmo to {port}."
msgstr "Çojeni Ser Anselmon {port@to}."

#. a line of thanks, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/19_paper_with_a_secret/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Ser Anselmo holds the page against the light."
msgstr "Ser Anselmo e mban faqen kundër dritës."

#. a line of thanks, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/19_paper_with_a_secret/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "\"See the watermark? This paper was made in Fabriano only this year!\""
msgstr "\"E shihni filigranin? Kjo letër u bë në Fabriano vetëm këtë vit!\""

#. a line of thanks, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/19_paper_with_a_secret/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "So it can not be twenty years old. That is our first proof!"
msgstr "Pra, nuk mund të jetë njëzetvjeçare. Kjo është prova jonë e parë!"

#. a line which a person says, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/19_paper_with_a_secret/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "A watermark never lies, captain."
msgstr "Filigrani nuk gënjen kurrë, {crew|kapiten|kapitene|kapitenë|kapitene}."

#. a line which a person says, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/19_paper_with_a_secret/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Count can forge words, but not the paper of Fabriano!"
msgstr "Konti mund të falsifikojë fjalët, por jo letrën e Fabrianos!"

#. the title of a mission, on its card
#: data/missions/19_paper_with_a_secret/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Paper with a Secret"
msgstr "Letra me një të fshehtë"

#. the summary of a mission, one or two short sentences
#: data/missions/19_paper_with_a_secret/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Find the paper merchant who can read the charter against the light. Proof 1: the watermark of "
"Fabriano."
msgstr "Gjeni tregtarin e letrës që e lexon kartën kundër dritës. Prova 1: filigrani i Fabrianos."

#. a fun fact at the end of a mission, at most three sentences
#: data/missions/19_paper_with_a_secret/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The paper mills of Fabriano were among the first in Europe. Their papermakers invented the "
"watermark: a picture inside the paper, which shows only against the light."
msgstr ""
"Mullinjtë e letrës në Fabriano ishin ndër të parët në Evropë. Letërbërësit e tyre shpikën "
"filigranin: një figurë brenda letrës, që duket vetëm kundër dritës."

#. the headline of the screen at the end of a mission, a few words
#: data/missions/19_paper_with_a_secret/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "The first proof!"
msgstr "Prova e parë!"

#. what the crew achieved, on the screen at the end of a mission, one sentence
#: data/missions/19_paper_with_a_secret/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "You found Ser Anselmo, and the watermark speaks."
msgstr "E gjetët Ser Anselmon dhe filigrani flet."

#. what the crew achieved, on the screen at the end of a mission, one sentence
#: data/missions/19_paper_with_a_secret/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Count's paper is new, not twenty years old."
msgstr "Letra e Kontit është e re, jo njëzetvjeçare."

#. a line which a person says, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/20_seal_maker_of_ortona/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Captain, the Count's seal looks like the seal of the Viceroy."
msgstr "{crew|Kapiten|Kapitene|Kapitenë|Kapitene}, vula e Kontit ngjan me vulën e Mëkëmbësit."

#. a line which a person says, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/20_seal_maker_of_ortona/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "A seal-maker of Ortona carved seals for him, then quit and hid."
msgstr "Një gdhendës vulash nga Ortona i bëri vulat, pastaj e la punën dhe u fsheh."

#. a line which a person says, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/20_seal_maker_of_ortona/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Find him! He can tell the judges the truth."
msgstr "Gjejeni! Ai mund t'u thotë gjykatësve të vërtetën."

#. a clue; {hallmark} is a noun phrase like 'a patched red sail'
#: data/missions/20_seal_maker_of_ortona/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "The seal-maker has {hallmark}."
msgstr "Gdhendësi i vulave ka {hallmark@acc}."

#. what the crew asks, or what the crew is asked
#: data/missions/20_seal_maker_of_ortona/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Have you seen the seal-maker who hides from the Count?"
msgstr "E keni parë gdhendësin e vulave që fshihet nga Konti?"

#. a line in the last port of a trail
#: data/missions/20_seal_maker_of_ortona/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "He is hiding here, among the craftsmen! But which one is he?"
msgstr "Ai fshihet këtu, mes zejtarëve! Po cili është ai?"

#. what the crew asks, or what the crew is asked
#: data/missions/20_seal_maker_of_ortona/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Which one is the seal-maker? Remember what the people told you!"
msgstr "Cili është gdhendësi i vulave? Kujtoni çfarë ju thanë njerëzit!"

#. a line after a wrong pick
#: data/missions/20_seal_maker_of_ortona/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "No, that is not the seal-maker! Think of everything you heard."
msgstr "Jo, ky nuk është gdhendësi i vulave! Kujtoni gjithçka që dëgjuat."

#. a line after the right pick
#: data/missions/20_seal_maker_of_ortona/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"\"Yes, I carved the Count's seal. He said it was for a play!\" Mastro Nunzio gives you the mould."
msgstr ""
"\"Po, unë e gdhenda vulën e Kontit. Tha se ishte për një shfaqje!\" Mastro Nunzio ju jep kallëpin."

#. the objective while sailing, on the banner
#: data/missions/20_seal_maker_of_ortona/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Bring the mould of the seal to {port}."
msgstr "Çojeni kallëpin e vulës {port@to}."

#. a line of thanks, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/20_seal_maker_of_ortona/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Look: the name of the King is spelt wrong on it!"
msgstr "Shikoni: emri i Mbretit është shkruar gabim!"

#. a line of thanks, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/20_seal_maker_of_ortona/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "No seal of the Viceroy has such a mistake. That is our second proof!"
msgstr "Asnjë vulë e Mëkëmbësit s'ka një gabim të tillë. Kjo është prova jonë e dytë!"

#. a line which a person says, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/20_seal_maker_of_ortona/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "I will tell the judges everything, captain."
msgstr "Do t'u tregoj gjykatësve gjithçka, {crew|kapiten|kapitene|kapitenë|kapitene}."

#. a line which a person says, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/20_seal_maker_of_ortona/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "From now on, I carve only honest seals!"
msgstr "Tani e tutje, gdhend vetëm vula të ndershme!"

#. the title of a mission, on its card
#: data/missions/20_seal_maker_of_ortona/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Seal-Maker of Ortona"
msgstr "Gdhendësi i vulave nga Ortona"

#. the summary of a mission, one or two short sentences
#: data/missions/20_seal_maker_of_ortona/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Find the seal-maker who quit the Count and hid. Proof 2: the false seal."
msgstr "Gjeni gdhendësin e vulave që e la Kontin dhe u fsheh. Prova 2: vula e rreme."

#. a fun fact at the end of a mission, at most three sentences
#: data/missions/20_seal_maker_of_ortona/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Ortona keeps the bones of St. Thomas the Apostle. Sailors of Ortona brought them from the Greek "
"island of Chios in 1258."
msgstr ""
"Ortona ruan eshtrat e Shën Thomait Apostull. Detarët e Ortonës i sollën nga ishulli grek i Kiosit "
"më 1258."

#. the headline of the screen at the end of a mission, a few words
#: data/missions/20_seal_maker_of_ortona/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "The second proof!"
msgstr "Prova e dytë!"

#. what the crew achieved, on the screen at the end of a mission, one sentence
#: data/missions/20_seal_maker_of_ortona/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "You found Mastro Nunzio, and the false seal is in Trani."
msgstr "E gjetët Mastro Nunzion dhe vula e rreme është në Trani."

#. what the crew achieved, on the screen at the end of a mission, one sentence
#: data/missions/20_seal_maker_of_ortona/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Count spelt the name of the King wrong!"
msgstr "Konti e shkroi gabim emrin e Mbretit!"

#. a line which a person says, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/21_white_rock/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Captain, an old fisherman here remembers the Count from long ago."
msgstr ""
"{crew|Kapiten|Kapitene|Kapitenë|Kapitene}, një peshkatar i vjetër këtu e mban mend Kontin prej "
"kohësh."

#. a line which a person says, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/21_white_rock/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "He says the Count was no count at all, but a young copyist: Bepi Sgorbio!"
msgstr "Thotë se Konti nuk ishte fare kont, por një kopist i ri: Bepi Sgorbio!"

#. a line which a person says, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/21_white_rock/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Bepi lived on the Gargano. Ask about him there."
msgstr "Bepi jetonte në Gargano. Pyetni për të atje."

#. a clue; {fact} is a noun phrase like 'the town with the great Roman arena'
#: data/missions/21_white_rock/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Bepi had a friend in {fact}."
msgstr "Lundroni {fact@to}: Bepi kishte një mik atje."

#. a clue; {fact} is a noun phrase like 'the town with the great Roman arena'
#: data/missions/21_white_rock/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Ask in {fact}. They knew Bepi there."
msgstr "Lundroni {fact@to} dhe pyetni. Atje e njihnin Bepin."

#. a clue; {fact} is a noun phrase like 'the town with the great Roman arena'
#: data/missions/21_white_rock/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Bepi copied letters for the people of {fact}."
msgstr "Lundroni {fact@to}: Bepi u kopjonte letra njerëzve atje."

#. what the crew asks, or what the crew is asked
#: data/missions/21_white_rock/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Did you know Bepi Sgorbio, the copyist?"
msgstr "E njihnit Bepi Sgorbion, kopistin?"

#. a line in the last port of a trail
#: data/missions/21_white_rock/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Bepi? He hid a box of his old letters in the cave under the white rock of Vieste!"
msgstr ""
"Bepin? Ai fshehu një kuti me letrat e tij të vjetra në shpellën nën shkëmbin e bardhë të Viestes!"

#. a line which a person says, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/21_white_rock/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "The cave under the white rock? I know the way, even in a storm!"
msgstr "Shpella nën shkëmbin e bardhë? E di rrugën, edhe në stuhi!"

#. a line which a person says, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/21_white_rock/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Here is the box. The letters are signed: Bepi Sgorbio, copyist."
msgstr "Ja kutia. Letrat janë nënshkruar: Bepi Sgorbio, kopist."

#. the objective while sailing, on the banner
#: data/missions/21_white_rock/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Fetch Bepi's old letters from the white rock."
msgstr "Merrni letrat e vjetra të Bepit te shkëmbi i bardhë."

#. the objective while sailing, on the banner
#: data/missions/21_white_rock/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Bring Bepi's letters to {port}."
msgstr "Çojini letrat e Bepit {port@to}."

#. a line of thanks, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/21_white_rock/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Let me compare them with the Count's charter..."
msgstr "Më lini t'i krahasoj me kartën e Kontit..."

#. a line of thanks, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/21_white_rock/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "The same hand wrote them both! That is our third proof!"
msgstr "I ka shkruar e njëjta dorë! Kjo është prova jonë e tretë!"

#. a line which a person says, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/21_white_rock/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Three proofs, captain: the paper, the seal and the letters!"
msgstr "Tri prova, {crew|kapiten|kapitene|kapitenë|kapitene}: letra, vula dhe letrat e Bepit!"

#. a line which a person says, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/21_white_rock/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "The \"Count\" is nobody but Bepi Sgorbio."
msgstr "\"Konti\" s'është tjetër veçse Bepi Sgorbio."

#. the title of a mission, on its card
#: data/missions/21_white_rock/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "The White Rock"
msgstr "Shkëmbi i bardhë"

#. the summary of a mission, one or two short sentences
#: data/missions/21_white_rock/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Storms around the Gargano. Under the white rock of Pizzomunno lie Bepi's old letters. Proof 3."
msgstr ""
"Stuhi rreth Garganos. Nën shkëmbin e bardhë të Pizzomunnos janë letrat e vjetra të Bepit. Prova 3."

#. a fun fact at the end of a mission, at most three sentences
#: data/missions/21_white_rock/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The tall white rock on the beach of Vieste is called Pizzomunno. A legend says it is a young "
"fisherman who turned to stone while he waited for his love Cristalda, whom the mermaids took away."
msgstr ""
"Shkëmbi i lartë i bardhë në plazhin e Viestes quhet Pizzomunno. Një legjendë thotë se është një "
"peshkatar i ri që u bë gur duke pritur të dashurën e tij Kristalda, që ia morën sirenat."

#. the headline of the screen at the end of a mission, a few words
#: data/missions/21_white_rock/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "The third proof!"
msgstr "Prova e tretë!"

#. what the crew achieved, on the screen at the end of a mission, one sentence
#: data/missions/21_white_rock/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "You braved the storms of the Gargano."
msgstr "I përballuat stuhitë e Garganos."

#. what the crew achieved, on the screen at the end of a mission, one sentence
#: data/missions/21_white_rock/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Bepi's old letters show who the Count really is."
msgstr "Letrat e vjetra të Bepit tregojnë kush është vërtet Konti."

#. a line which a person says, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/22_challenge_of_barletta/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Captain, the Count is furious about the three proofs."
msgstr "{crew|Kapiten|Kapitene|Kapitenë|Kapitene}, Konti është tërbuar për tri provat."

#. a line which a person says, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/22_challenge_of_barletta/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "He dares you to a regatta at Barletta: thirteen boats, like the thirteen knights of 1503!"
msgstr ""
"Ju sfidon në një regatë në Barleta: trembëdhjetë barka, si të trembëdhjetë kalorësit e vitit 1503!"

#. a line which a person says, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/22_challenge_of_barletta/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "If you win, the whole coast will see that his charms are nothing."
msgstr "Nëse fitoni, gjithë bregu do ta shohë se hajmalitë e tij s'vlejnë asgjë."

#. what a rival says when he dares the crew to a race, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/22_challenge_of_barletta/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Welcome to the Challenge of Barletta, captain!"
msgstr "Mirë se erdhët në Sfidën e Barletës, {crew|kapiten|kapitene|kapitenë|kapitene}!"

#. what a rival says when he dares the crew to a race, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/22_challenge_of_barletta/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Thirteen boats, three buoys, and glory for the winner!"
msgstr "Trembëdhjetë barka, tri bova dhe lavdi për fituesin!"

#. what a rival says when he dares the crew to a race, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/22_challenge_of_barletta/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "My yellow boat will leave you all behind!"
msgstr "Barka ime e verdhë do t'ju lërë të gjithëve pas!"

#. what a rival says before a rematch of a race, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/22_challenge_of_barletta/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Ha! Back for another lesson?"
msgstr "Ha! Erdhët për një mësim tjetër?"

#. what a rival says before a rematch of a race, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/22_challenge_of_barletta/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Again: thirteen boats, three buoys!"
msgstr "Edhe një herë: trembëdhjetë barka, tri bova!"

#. what the crew hears after winning a race, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/22_challenge_of_barletta/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Impossible! I took the short way, and you still won?"
msgstr "E pamundur! Mora rrugën e shkurtër, dhe prapë fituat?"

#. what the crew hears after winning a race, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/22_challenge_of_barletta/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "The crowd of Barletta cheers for the fair captain!"
msgstr ""
"Turma e Barletës brohorit për {crew|kapitenin e ndershëm|kapitenen e ndershme|kapitenët e "
"ndershëm|kapitenet e ndershme}!"

#. what the crew hears when a rival won the race, one short sentence
#: data/missions/22_challenge_of_barletta/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Count was back first, but he cheated! The fishermen ask for a rematch tomorrow."
msgstr "Konti u kthye i pari, por mashtroi! Peshkatarët kërkojnë revansh nesër."

#. what the crew hears when a rival cheats in a race, one short sentence
#: data/missions/22_challenge_of_barletta/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Count cuts through the shallows and skips a buoy! That's cheating!"
msgstr "Konti pret nëpër cekëtina dhe kapërcen një bovë! Kjo është mashtrim!"

#. a line which a person says, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/22_challenge_of_barletta/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "The whole town saw it: the Count cheated, and you won fairly!"
msgstr "E pa gjithë qyteti: Konti mashtroi dhe ju fituat ndershmërisht!"

#. a line which a person says, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/22_challenge_of_barletta/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "I hammered you a horseshoe, for luck."
msgstr "Ju farkëtova një patkua, për fat."

#. the title of a mission, on its card
#: data/missions/22_challenge_of_barletta/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Challenge of Barletta"
msgstr "Sfida e Barletës"

#. the summary of a mission, one or two short sentences
#: data/missions/22_challenge_of_barletta/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The Count dares the crew to a regatta of thirteen boats, as the thirteen knights of 1503. He "
"cheats through the shallows; the crew wins fairly."
msgstr ""
"Konti e sfidon ekipazhin në një regatë me trembëdhjetë barka, si të trembëdhjetë kalorësit e vitit"
" 1503. Ai mashtron nëpër cekëtina; ekipazhi fiton ndershmërisht."

#. a fun fact at the end of a mission, at most three sentences
#: data/missions/22_challenge_of_barletta/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The Challenge of Barletta in 1503 began with an insult at a dinner: a French knight said that the "
"Italians were poor knights. Thirteen knights of each side met in a tournament, and the Italians "
"won."
msgstr ""
"Sfida e Barletës më 1503 nisi me një fyerje në një darkë: një kalorës francez tha se italianët "
"ishin kalorës të dobët. Trembëdhjetë kalorës nga secila palë u ndeshën në një turne dhe fituan "
"italianët."

#. the headline of the screen at the end of a mission, a few words
#: data/missions/22_challenge_of_barletta/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "A fair win!"
msgstr "Fitore e ndershme!"

#. what the crew achieved, on the screen at the end of a mission, one sentence
#: data/missions/22_challenge_of_barletta/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Count cut through the shallows, and still you won."
msgstr "Konti preu nëpër cekëtina, e megjithatë ju fituat."

#. what the crew achieved, on the screen at the end of a mission, one sentence
#: data/missions/22_challenge_of_barletta/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "All of Barletta saw who sails fairly."
msgstr "Gjithë Barleta pa kush lundron ndershmërisht."

#. a line which a person says, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/23_oil_for_monopoli/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Captain! It's me, Luka, the ship's boy. Remember?"
msgstr "{crew|Kapiten|Kapitene|Kapitenë|Kapitene}! Jam unë, Luka, djali i anijes. Më mbani mend?"

#. a line which a person says, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/23_oil_for_monopoli/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Count bought up all the olive oil, and he sells it at three times the price."
msgstr "Konti bleu gjithë vajin e ullirit dhe e shet tre herë më shtrenjtë."

#. a line which a person says, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/23_oil_for_monopoli/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "But Vito of Monopoli hid some olives. Help him press them!"
msgstr "Por Vito nga Monopoli fshehu ca ullinj. Ndihmojeni t'i shtrydhë!"

#. a line which a person says, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/23_oil_for_monopoli/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Take this salt along: on this coast, salt buys almost anything."
msgstr "Merreni me vete këtë kripë: në këtë breg, me kripë blen pothuajse gjithçka."

#. what a person in a chain of trades wants, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/23_oil_for_monopoli/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "My olives are picked, but the Count's men took my pressing mats."
msgstr "Ullinjtë i kam mbledhur, por njerëzit e Kontit m'i morën rrogozët e presës."

#. what a person in a chain of trades wants, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/23_oil_for_monopoli/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Without mats, the press gives no oil. Donata of Brindisi weaves them!"
msgstr "Pa rrogozë, presa s'jep vaj. Donata nga Brindizi i thur!"

#. what a person says after a trade, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/23_oil_for_monopoli/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Fine mats! The press is turning..."
msgstr "Rrogozë të mirë! Presa po rrotullohet..."

#. what a person says after a trade, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/23_oil_for_monopoli/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Here is the oil, captain. Take it to the market of Bari."
msgstr "Ja vaji, {crew|kapiten|kapitene|kapitenë|kapitene}. Çojeni në tregun e Barit."

#. what a person in a chain of trades wants, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/23_oil_for_monopoli/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "I weave pressing mats from rushes."
msgstr "Unë thur rrogozë për presë nga xunkthi."

#. what a person in a chain of trades wants, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/23_oil_for_monopoli/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "But I need salt for my fish. Do you have salt?"
msgstr "Por më duhet kripë për peshkun. Keni kripë?"

#. what a person says after a trade, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/23_oil_for_monopoli/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Salt! Now my fish keeps all winter."
msgstr "Kripë! Tani peshku im mban gjithë dimrin."

#. what a person says after a trade, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/23_oil_for_monopoli/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Here are my best pressing mats."
msgstr "Ja rrogozët e mi më të mirë."

#. the objective while sailing, on the banner
#: data/missions/23_oil_for_monopoli/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Bring the oil to the market of {port}."
msgstr "Çojeni vajin në treg, {port@to}."

#. a line of thanks, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/23_oil_for_monopoli/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Oil from Monopoli, at a fair price!"
msgstr "Vaj nga Monopoli, me çmim të drejtë!"

#. a line of thanks, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/23_oil_for_monopoli/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Now everybody in Bari can cook again."
msgstr "Tani gjithë Bari mund të gatuajë sërish."

#. a line which a person says, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/23_oil_for_monopoli/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Count's oil sits in his cellar, and nobody buys it!"
msgstr "Vaji i Kontit rri në bodrumin e tij dhe askush s'e blen!"

#. a line which a person says, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/23_oil_for_monopoli/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Captain, I will keep my eyes open for him."
msgstr "{crew|Kapiten|Kapitene|Kapitenë|Kapitene}, do ta mbaj syrin hapur për të."

#. the title of a mission, on its card
#: data/missions/23_oil_for_monopoli/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Oil for Monopoli"
msgstr "Vaj për Monopolin"

#. the summary of a mission, one or two short sentences
#: data/missions/23_oil_for_monopoli/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The Count hoards the olive oil. Trade salt for pressing mats, the mats for oil, and bring it to "
"the market of Bari."
msgstr ""
"Konti grumbullon vajin e ullirit. Shkëmbeni kripën me rrogozë, rrogozët me vaj dhe çojeni në "
"tregun e Barit."

#. a fun fact at the end of a mission, at most three sentences
#: data/missions/23_oil_for_monopoli/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"In Apulia, many olive mills were dug into the rock under the ground. It was warm down there in "
"winter, so the oil flowed better."
msgstr ""
"Në Pulja, shumë mullinj vaji u gërmuan në shkëmb, nën tokë. Atje poshtë ishte ngrohtë në dimër, "
"ndaj vaji rridhte më mirë."

#. the headline of the screen at the end of a mission, a few words
#: data/missions/23_oil_for_monopoli/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Fair oil for Bari!"
msgstr "Vaj i ndershëm për Barin!"

#. what the crew achieved, on the screen at the end of a mission, one sentence
#: data/missions/23_oil_for_monopoli/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Salt, mats and a lot of sailing beat the Count's prices."
msgstr "Kripa, rrogozët dhe shumë lundrim i mundën çmimet e Kontit."

#. what the crew achieved, on the screen at the end of a mission, one sentence
#: data/missions/23_oil_for_monopoli/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "The kitchens of Bari smell of fresh oil."
msgstr "Kuzhinat e Barit mbajnë erë vaj të freskët."

#. a line which a person says, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/24_count_flees/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Captain, the Count has fled with his Golden Charter!"
msgstr "{crew|Kapiten|Kapitene|Kapitenë|Kapitene}, Konti iku me Kartën e tij të Artë!"

#. a line which a person says, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/24_count_flees/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Without the charter, the judges can not see his forgery."
